{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-tracker-services-1-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"17","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-1","refs":["F-phone-527"],"severity":"S4","title":"When the trainer renames a workout plan, the member's phone keeps the old name","what":"Renaming a plan on the panel sends the member's phone a new version of it. The phone takes the new exercises from that version but keeps the folder's first name, so the member and the trainer call the same plan by two different names.","expected":"A new version from the gym brings the new name too, unless the member renamed the folder on the phone.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/gymPlansSync.ts:116-120","apps/mobile/src/tracker/lib/gymPlanSteps.ts:40-46","supabase/migrations/0024_workout_plans.sql:150-153","supabase/migrations/0024_workout_plans.sql:211"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"gym-plan-update-keeps-old-name","who":"members on Pro gyms whose trainer renames a plan","how_often":"every rename of a plan already on a phone","fix_line":"Take the gym's new name on an update, keeping only a name the member typed","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
